    "editorial_transformation": "The public-domain two-staff MIDI was separated into soprano, alto, tenor, and bass by sustained-note continuity and minimum-motion voice leading. Its final release gate was restored to the written cadence. CCEH catalogues the final four short lines separately as 4.4.4.4; the official Scottish Psalter recommendation treats each adjacent pair as one 8-syllable line.",
